nd ask Mara and Tessa to verify the caravan's sealed measures together, rather than privately accepting blame. He ends more willing to challenge his own order openly and to make shared accountability part of his service.","home_location_id":"loc_granary_hill","faction_id":"fac_seed_keepers","personality_traits":["earnest","observant","self-effacing","resourceful"],"abilities":[{"name":"Pack handling","description":"Can secure sacks and maintain animal harnesses with salvaged hand tools during a long caravan crossing.","category":"physical"},{"name":"Seal checking","description":"Knows how to inspect the keeper's seals on seed sacks and notice signs of tampering.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_alen","source_character_id":"chr_mara_vell","target_character_id":"chr_alen_dorr","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Mara Vell and Alen Dorr distrust each other's institutions: she suspects the weigh-house ledger, while he resents the Seed Keepers' authority to judge it."},{"id":"rel_alen_mara","source_character_id":"chr_alen_dorr","target_character_id":"chr_mara_vell","relationship_type":"uneasy ally","description":"Alen Dorr relies on Mara Vell's caravan records to compare the tithe measures, though he fears her judgment could revive the old blame against the millers."},{"id":"rel_tessa_mara","source_character_id":"chr_tessa_ryn","target_character_id":"chr_mara_vell","relationship_type":"distrustful ally","description":"Tessa Ryn needs Mara Vell to carry grafting stock to the Ash Orchards, but distrusts the keeper's promises after years of unmet claims."},{"id":"rel_joren_mara","source_character_id":"chr_joren_pell","target_character_id":"chr_mara_vell","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Joren Pell looks to Mara Vell as his mentor and caravan leader, but his concern over the orchard claim pushes him to question her decisions."},{"id":"rel_tessa_alen","source_character_id":"chr_tessa_ryn","target_character_id":"chr_alen_dorr","relati