":"Seal verification","description":"Identifies authentic map seals and detects tampering without opening the sealed document.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Chart custody","description":"Maintains registration records and can trace a map's documented transfers.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_nessa_vail","name":"Nessa Vail","role":"supporting","description":"A grower in the Cinder Gardens, Nessa tends sunward glasshouses whose harvests feed crews waiting out the comet's long crossings. She once piloted supply runs before an unpaid ice-tithe cost her berth, and she now keeps careful notes on which ships and workers have been stranded by tether purchases. Broad-shouldered, with copper-colored goggles and a streak of greenhouse ash on one cheek, she speaks plainly and remembers every favor owed.","home_location_id":"loc_cinder_gardens","motivation":"Keep ordinary crews from paying for a route dispute with their food, berths, and livelihoods.","goal":"Bring evidence of coercive tether sales and tithe pressure into the Long Hall hearing.","flaw":"She waits for perfect proof before speaking, even when delay lets an injustice deepen.","internal_conflict":"Nessa wants to be useful to the people harmed by the barons, but fears that testifying will cost her the fragile place she has rebuilt.","external_conflict":"Orrin's agents can threaten her garden access, while the approaching burn gives the hearing little time to verify the pilots' claims.","arc":"Nessa begins keeping her records private, convinced that incomplete evidence will only invite retaliation. When a pilot she once flew with loses a berth over an ice-tithe claim, she chooses to carry her dated sale notes to Mara despite the risk to her garden allotment. She ends as a public witness who accepts that useful evidence can be imperfect, and that silence also has a cost.","personality_traits":["practical","patient","compassionate","quietly stubborn"],"abilities":[{"name":"Glasshouse cultivation","description":"Keeps food crops alive through shifts in light, temperature, and the comet's rotation.","category":"other"},{"name":"Witness records","description":"Maintains precise notes on deliveries, berth changes, and the people affected by tithe disputes.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_tamsin","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rell","relationship_type":"adversarial","description":"Mara must arbitrate Tamsin's salvage claim to the stolen sealed map; Tamsin's refusal to trust the guild makes the hearing harder."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_mara","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rell","target_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","relationship_type":"uneasy ally","description":"Tamsin resists Mara's authority but comes to rely on her promise of a witnessed, fair hearing."},{"id":"rel_mara_orrin","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_orrin_kest","relationship_type":"opponent","description":"Mara's inquiry threatens Orrin's plan to exploit the map dispute and acquire tether rights before the burn."},{"id":"rel_orrin_ives","source_character_id":"chr_orrin_kest","target_character_id":"chr_ives_solen","relationship_type":"leverage","description":"Orrin pressures Ives to defend the guild's custody record, while Ives's testimony could expose the map's irregular transfer."},{"id":"rel_nessa_orrin","source_character_id":"chr_nessa_vail","target_character_id":"chr_orrin_kest","relationship_type":"witness","description":"Nessa's records connect Orrin's tether purchases to unpaid-tithe pressure that stranded pilots."},{"id":"rel_nessa_tamsin","source_character_id":"chr_nessa_vail","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rell","relationship_type":"former crewmates","description":"Nessa once flew supply runs with Tamsin and knows why Tamsin distrusts sealed routes, but she disapproves of the theft."},{"id":"rel_mara_ives","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_ives_solen","relationship_type":"m