n":"Keeps food crops alive through shifts in light, temperature, and the comet's rotation.","category":"other"},{"name":"Witness records","description":"Maintains precise notes on deliveries, berth changes, and the people affected by tithe disputes.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_tamsin","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rell","relationship_type":"adversarial","description":"Mara must arbitrate Tamsin's salvage claim to the stolen sealed map; Tamsin's refusal to trust the guild makes the hearing harder."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_mara","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rell","target_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","relationship_type":"uneasy ally","description":"Tamsin resists Mara's authority but comes to rely on her promise of a witnessed, fair hearing."},{"id":"rel_mara_orrin","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_orrin_kest","relationship_type":"opponent","description":"Mara's inquiry threatens Orrin's plan to exploit the map dispute and acquire tether rights before the burn."},{"id":"rel_orrin_ives","source_character_id":"chr_orrin_kest","target_character_id":"chr_ives_solen","relationship_type":"leverage","description":"Orrin pressures Ives to defend the guild's custody record, while Ives's testimony could expose the map's irregular transfer."},{"id":"rel_nessa_orrin","source_character_id":"chr_nessa_vail","target_character_id":"chr_orrin_kest","relationship_type":"witness","description":"Nessa's records connect Orrin's tether purchases to unpaid-tithe pressure that stranded pilots."},{"id":"rel_nessa_tamsin","source_character_id":"chr_nessa_vail","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rell","relationship_type":"former crewmates","description":"Nessa once flew supply runs with Tamsin and knows why Tamsin distrusts sealed routes, but she disapproves of the theft."},{"id":"rel_mara_ives","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_ives_solen","relationship_type":"m